From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Conor McCarthy <cmccarthy@codeweavers.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jan 2025 15:37:56 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] winegstreamer: Do not unref the buffer in
 push_vorbis_headers().

gst_value_get_buffer() does not return a reference to the buffer.

(cherry picked from commit a76b7b113ea5e7b2e58ba43fc250313b03d741de)
---
 dlls/winegstreamer/wg_transform.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winegstreamer/wg_transform.c b/dlls/winegstreamer/wg_transform.c
index c071b5335f4..7b4d97f5951 100644
--- a/dlls/winegstreamer/wg_transform.c
+++ b/dlls/winegstreamer/wg_transform.c
@@ -609,7 +609,6 @@ static void push_vorbis_headers(struct wg_transform *transform)
 
 failed:
     gst_buffer_unmap(codec_data, &info);
-    gst_buffer_unref(codec_data);
 }
 
 
